script = ExtResource("2_igapc")
day_to_send = 1
sender_name = "tuckerwertham@bmail.com"
displayed_time = "7am"
subject = "Congratulations"
recipient_name = "Employee #000000"
contents = "Dear Valued Employee,

Congratulations on your new role of [b]AI Cafe Manager[/b] at [b][i]cAIfe[/i][/b] (formerly [i]King of Comics Cafe[/i]), a subsidiary of [b]BOOGLE INC.[/b], the leading front of automated third spaces.

Here, it’s not just about the drinks—it’s about the customers. So during your shift, please remember to adhere to company policy and be mindful of the following rules:
- Let our AI-powered agent, [b][i]Tippy[/i][/b], handle the drinks.
- Always make the customer happy!

[b][i]Please note that failure to comply may result in immediate and uncompensated termination.[/i][/b]
"
